00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:31.250
Also make sure to subscribe.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:32.399
Oh Yeah you should subs...

00:16:32.399 --> 00:16:37.519
Get the hell out of here.

00:16:37.519 --> 00:16:39.940
Part II!!

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:41.990
Im's Origin and History.

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:44.190
First, the giant jack and Enel.

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:49.029
We already talked about how important skypea
was as an arc in the last video.

00:16:49.029 --> 00:16:54.160
And so Enel of course declaring himself god
and being taken down by luffy, the natural

00:16:54.160 --> 00:17:00.079
enemy of gods, makes it really easy for me
to form a connection between Enel and Im.

00:17:00.079 --> 00:17:01.950
Again two sides of the same coin.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:08.120
So instead of eve we have the giant jack,
instead of marijoe we have the land of god,

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:09.120
you get the idea.

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:15.280
Enel is a fake god without wings, ruling over
the sky people and traveling up to the moon

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:16.800
to god's realm.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:23.370
So if we invert this, does that mean Im is
a real god with wings, ruling over fake gods

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:27.270
after coming down from the moon from god's
realm?

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:28.270
Yeah.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:29.590
But it's not quite what you think.

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:34.020
A likely inspiration for Im is the story of
Princess Kaguya.

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:37.700
If you watched Naruto, you're probably already
familiar with this.

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:41.620
But if your first reaction to this was the
same as mine - damn now they're gonna ruin

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:44.360
one piece the same way as Naruto - no worries!

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:46.720
It actually makes way more sense here.

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:47.720
Let me summarize the story as quickly as possible
for you.

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:48.720
One day an old bamboo cutter cuts shiny bamboo
and finds a kid in the bamboo.

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:49.720
The man and his wife raise the kid, who quickly
turns into a beautiful bamboo woman.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:50.720
From then on out every time the bamboo cutter
cuts bamboo, he finds a gold nugget.

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:51.720
He's now a rich bamboo cutter.

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:52.720
The princess quickly is desired by everyone.

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:53.720
5 nobles come cause they want a piece of this
bamboo, but she doesn't want to marry any

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:54.720
of them and she gives them impossible tasks,
so they all fail.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:55.720
Next comes the emperor and wants to merry
the bamboo girl.

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:56.720
This time bamboo girl is more interested,
but still doesn't want to marry him.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:57.720
But they become pen pals and write lots of
letters.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:58.720
One day, when Kaguya watches the moon she
remembers she's actually from the moon and

00:17:58.720 --> 00:17:59.720
was sent to earth as A punishment or B to
protect her by the moon people, depending

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:00.720
on the version.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:01.720
And so her pen pal the emperor sends guards
to protect her, but when the moon people come

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:02.720
to take the princess back, the guards are
blinded by a strange light.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:03.720
Kaguya now announces that she must go back,
even though she loves all her friends on earth.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:04.720
She sends the emperor a good bye letter as
well as the elixir of immortality, not too

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.720
bad, and one of the moon people places a feather
robe on her shoulders.

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:06.720
That moment she looses all her sadness and
compassion and love she had for earth and

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:07.720
she returns to the city on the moon.

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:08.720
The emperor then tries to send her a letter
by sending his army to carry it to the top

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:09.720
of highest mountain and burn it there.

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:10.720
Which is why Mount Fuji is literally the mountain
abundant with soldiers.

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:11.720
The smoke of the letter can still be seen
there to this day, only it's of course a volcano.

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:12.720
You already correctly guessed that im resembles
Kaguya.

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:13.720
The 5 nobles might represent the gorosei.

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:14.720
Bamboo is also represented by Virgo in the
donquixote pirates.

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:15.720
We even have the potion of immortality thrown
in there.

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:16.720
Kaguya returned to the moon, handed over the
potion of immortality and got her memories

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:17.720
erased.

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:18.720
Inverting that, Im came from the moon, took
immortality for herself and erased everyones

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:19.720
memories.

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:20.720
The feathered coat of course also connects
this to doflamingo, who literally has no compassion

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:21.720
for others.

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:25.890
His bird cage might then be a metaphor for
Im's control of the world, or maybe even the

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:29.270
moon, which might be an ancient weapon used
to create floods.

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:34.200
However, as we will see, Im is not actually
a citizen of the moon, as they prepared an

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:37.330
army against whoever invaded them.

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:42.130
Given that their descendants fought against
the ancient kingdom they most likely were

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:43.130
Im's enemies.

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:47.540
So, if not a sky person, who is Im then?

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:52.410
Let's return then to the idea of the celestial
dragons wearing space suits.

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:57.250
These suits, as well as the hoof of the dragon
are the main two symbols that we associate

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:58.800
with the nobles.

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:04.090
Now this may sound weird, but I'm gonna show
you a fresco from a monastery in Kosovo, which

00:19:04.090 --> 00:19:05.840
is a world heritage site.

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:10.490
In the middle we see Jesus and on the top
right there is this guy here.

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:15.940
Now this was painted in the 14th century,
and I guess it won't surprise you to find

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:24.500
out that many have taken this to be the depiction
of a space ship by the unknown artist.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:30.210
What interests US here however, is whether
Oda might have taken this symbol as inspiration,

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:34.710
making Im someone who came to earth from somewhere
else.

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:40.900
Because if you turn this symbol by 90 degrees,
you perfectly get the symbol of the celestial

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:41.900
dragons.

00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:45.520
And an interesting detail I noticed as well
when looking at this, was the sphere with

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:51.260
8 orbs surrounding it, that we know from Alabasta,
Wano and Shandora.

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:53.560
But is Oda even into aliens?

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:59.330
Well, let me look at the first volume of One
Piece and... oh.

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:02.120
Now let's go down the alien route a bit more.

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:05.430
I mean, there are space pirates and all.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:10.501
Oda mentioned in another author's note section
of volume 96, that when you turn 96 on its

00:20:10.501 --> 00:20:12.890
head, you don't get 69.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:21.730
And the idea of turning things on its head
are a pretty fundamental concept in one piece.

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:28.580
[Roger] Now this seems to be related to the
story in the manga.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:33.730
But - could it be that Oda is telling us to
turn the literal Manga on it's head?

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:35.650
Well, let's try.

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:36.850
- Hmm.

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:41.920
So I think it doesn't take too much fantasy
to see the straw hat as a flying saucer.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.570
With the moon above it.

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:47.970
However what is really interesting I think
is that the skull suddenly also becomes a

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:49.320
new face.

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:56.280
The nose flipped on its head becomes a face
with 2 eyes and a THIRD eye on top of it.

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:58.040
Well where have we seen that before?

00:20:58.040 --> 00:21:01.770
The mouth of the skull then turns into this
elongated head.

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:07.580
But that would be ridiculous, who would have
a head like...oh right the symbol of the literal

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:12.310
space pirate we saw as well as Fukurokuju
in Wano.

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:14.920
Im also has this elongated shape.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:18.650
So could her and Fukurokuju be of the same
race?

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:22.630
The three eyed tribe, that we now know exists,
thanks to puddings introduction.

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:26.290
But then Fukurokuju would also need to have
a third eye.

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:29.280
And he clearly doesn't..or does he?

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:31.450
Look at this patch of skin on his forehead.

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:34.460
This looks very suspiciously like an eye.

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:39.720
And we actually don't know what his other
eye-lids look like, since conveniently wears

00:21:39.720 --> 00:21:40.720
sun-glasses.

00:21:40.720 --> 00:21:45.910
Also to hide the fact that he has the same
ringed eyes as Im?

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:49.830
He even has this large wrinkle when he is
depicted as a young man.

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:54.700
And if Fukurokujo gets longer and longer with
age, wouldn't that mean that Im would have

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:58.380
had a lot of time to get really long with
age as well?

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:04.070
Which would also connect Enel to this, who
has the same buddha-like ear-lobes.

00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:08.300
We already know that the three-eyed-tribe
is said to have unique abilities.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:11.760
Shiva, the supreme god of Hinduism, also has
a third eye.

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:14.500
And it can also be seen on many Buddha statues.

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:20.010
And even in the west, there is the famous
eye of providence, which represents the all-seeing

00:22:20.010 --> 00:22:21.250
eye of god.

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:24.510
In the world of one piece, the third eye is
able to decipher the poneglyphs.

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:25.510
And where do we meet Fukurokujo the very first
time?

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:26.510
Oh right!

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:27.510
In the poneglyph room under the castle.

00:22:27.510 --> 00:22:28.510
Pudding is only half third eye.

00:22:28.510 --> 00:22:33.281
So when the third eye is truly opened, does
it have the ability to see all things, like

00:22:33.281 --> 00:22:34.830
clairvoyance?

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:39.860
And speaking of clairvoyance, that would fit
with Viola's ability, as one of the members

00:22:39.860 --> 00:22:41.640
of the Donquite pirates.

00:22:41.640 --> 00:22:47.930
Viola appeared to Sanji sitting on a chair,
again summoning the image of Im on her throne.

00:22:47.930 --> 00:22:52.360
Mihawk, who has Im's eyes, also apprised the
first time sitting on a chair.

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:58.990
And funnily enough, the same is true of Pudding,
who we also meet sitting in a chair.

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:01.370
Same goes for alvida, who is able to rejuvenate
herself and also Hancock, who teaches us about

00:23:01.370 --> 00:23:05.580
the mark of the celestial dragons and who
is able to turn people into stone.

00:23:05.580 --> 00:23:09.830
The stone is actually another symbol closely
linked to Im.

00:23:09.830 --> 00:23:12.611
In chapter 877, we see how Big Mom is able
to shorten peoples lifespans, while at the

00:23:12.611 --> 00:23:16.540
same time Pedro blows himself up.

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:20.730
Two sides of the same coin with dr hiruluk's
death in drum island.

00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:24.030
The word pay for this chapter is Ba na na.

00:23:24.030 --> 00:23:25.030
Banana.

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:27.620
So what does a banana have to do with stone?

00:23:27.620 --> 00:23:28.850
You'll like this one.

00:23:28.850 --> 00:23:32.890
There is a very common type of myth in Asia,
called banana type myths.

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:37.870
Which let's be real for a sec, is the best
name of anything ever.

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:42.010
They all are a bit different depending on
the region, but all these tales follow the

00:23:42.010 --> 00:23:46.310
same pattern: A god presented a stone and
a banana to a person.

00:23:46.310 --> 00:23:51.990
The person choses the banana, cause at least
they can eat it.

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:58.840
However, the changeless stone is a symbol
of immortality, so if person had chosen the

00:23:58.840 --> 00:24:00.600
stone, they would have become immortal.

00:24:00.600 --> 00:24:06.570
By choosing the banana however, that rots
fast, they chose a short and mortal life.

00:24:06.570 --> 00:24:13.250
Now if Im represents the godly and immortal
stone, who could represent the human and fast-lived

00:24:13.250 --> 00:24:14.960
banana in One Piece?

00:24:14.960 --> 00:24:15.960
Exactly.

00:24:15.960 --> 00:24:16.960
Kaido.

00:24:16.960 --> 00:24:20.840
I'm just kidding, it's Monkey D. Dragon and
Monkey D. Luffy, the two main threats to Im's

00:24:20.840 --> 00:24:21.840
rule.

00:24:21.840 --> 00:24:25.100
And now what is really interesting is that
in the Japanese version of this myth, the

00:24:25.100 --> 00:24:28.220
banana is replaced by a flower.

00:24:28.220 --> 00:24:34.710
And that brings me to probably THE most interesting
connection to Im sama of them all.

00:24:34.710 --> 00:24:41.690
Nico Robin, user of the flower fruit.

00:24:41.690 --> 00:24:45.540
Robin and Im are, you guessed it, two sides
of the same coin.

00:24:45.540 --> 00:24:49.530
Im is 1 6, while robin is 6 1.

00:24:49.530 --> 00:24:54.420
Robin's hometown, O'Hara, which has disappeared
from the world map, is the exact opposite

00:24:54.420 --> 00:24:58.330
of the world's center, the sacred city of
Mariejoe.

00:24:58.330 --> 00:25:03.740
On Ohara there is the tree of knowledge while
on Marijoe, there is Eve, who got cast out

00:25:03.740 --> 00:25:07.590
of paradise for eating from said tree of knowledge.

00:25:07.590 --> 00:25:13.810
Robin's protector is Dr. Clover, who is directly
connected to the Gorosei, who protect Im.

00:25:13.810 --> 00:25:19.240
[...] And look at chapters 936 and 237, where
Robin literally uses a third eye.

00:25:19.240 --> 00:25:26.360
Robin has the flower fruit, while Im is seen
in her flower garden in Pangea castle.

00:25:26.360 --> 00:25:30.620
And Robin might also be the greatest hint
at Im's backstory.

00:25:30.620 --> 00:25:32.350
She is the devil child.

00:25:32.350 --> 00:25:36.640
So reversing that, Im sama could be seen as
the child of god.

00:25:36.640 --> 00:25:42.440
While robin was feared and hated for her abilities,
Im might have been valued and cherished for

00:25:42.440 --> 00:25:43.440
hers.

00:25:43.440 --> 00:25:48.250
However, maybe just like Robin, people will
have tried to exploit her for it.

00:25:48.250 --> 00:25:53.320
Another parallel is how Big mom used to hate
pudding and treat her just like Robin was

00:25:53.320 --> 00:25:57.890
treated, until she found out about the three
eyed powers, when she suddenly became Big

00:25:57.890 --> 00:25:59.120
Mom's favorite.

00:25:59.120 --> 00:26:08.440
But she still was exploited anyways.

00:26:08.440 --> 00:26:17.039
Remember what Saul shouted to Robin through
the fires of her burning home?

00:26:17.039 --> 00:26:19.970
[...] He says Robin will not be alone forever.

00:26:19.970 --> 00:26:24.140
So Im probably has been alone forever.

00:26:24.140 --> 00:26:27.270
As far as we know, only the Gorosei even know
of her existence.

00:26:27.270 --> 00:26:33.270
A person ruling in secret from a Thorne that
is not supposed to even exist.

00:26:33.270 --> 00:26:38.810
And let's stick with Saul here for a moment
and look at the symbol of the frozen giants.

00:26:38.810 --> 00:26:42.570
Because his introduction into the story was
very interesting in many ways.

00:26:42.570 --> 00:26:49.010
A giant with the will of D., Saul is a reference
to the devoted Jew Saul, who one day was blinded

00:26:49.010 --> 00:26:54.190
by a heavenly light and through a sign form
Jesus upon which he converted to Christianity

00:26:54.190 --> 00:26:56.190
and became Paul.

00:26:56.190 --> 00:27:01.610
Similar to this Saul converted away form the
celestial dragons to help the people of Ohara.

00:27:01.610 --> 00:27:05.190
An interesting detail here, in English we
know him as Jaguar d.

00:27:05.190 --> 00:27:06.190
Saul.

00:27:06.190 --> 00:27:08.710
However Jaguar is not his name in Japanese.

00:27:08.710 --> 00:27:10.200
Not even close.

00:27:10.200 --> 00:27:11.330
It's Actually Haguwaru.

00:27:11.330 --> 00:27:14.570
Haguwaru D. Hugging the world.

00:27:14.570 --> 00:27:19.930
Which makes sense to me, because he's the
one who tells Robin that there are many gently

00:27:19.930 --> 00:27:26.040
giants as well.

00:27:26.040 --> 00:27:31.680
What connects Robin and her frozen giant to
Im then, is, you guessed it, the giant frozen

00:27:31.680 --> 00:27:33.900
Hat deep under Marijoe.

00:27:33.900 --> 00:27:36.960
Could this straw hat belong to Sauls ancestor?

00:27:36.960 --> 00:27:41.400
A good giant with the Name D. And a straw
hat.

00:27:41.400 --> 00:27:45.250
And what if I told you that we already had
that in the story?

00:27:45.250 --> 00:27:48.290
Another frozen giant, is Oars on Thriller
bark.

00:27:48.290 --> 00:27:56.220
And he literally takes on Luffy's personality,
when Moria puts his shadow in him.

00:27:56.220 --> 00:28:00.110
Luffy, but a giant.

00:28:00.110 --> 00:28:03.500
That's the symbol of the person who wore that
giant straw hat.

00:28:03.500 --> 00:28:08.160
Which is why we see Luffy smiling at us, when
Im enters the room.

00:28:08.160 --> 00:28:12.080
Now the big question is of course: Why did
Im keep it?

00:28:12.080 --> 00:28:16.240
Shouldn't the D. who wore it be the natural
enemy of her?

00:28:16.240 --> 00:28:20.660
Again, it's Robin that I think might give
us the decisive clue here.

00:28:20.660 --> 00:28:31.560
Robin's defining character moment is of course
this.

00:28:31.560 --> 00:28:33.840
[...] So what's the inversion of this for
Im?

00:28:33.840 --> 00:28:35.500
I want to die?

00:28:35.500 --> 00:28:40.250
Actually no, what is probably the case here
is that the inversion of I want to live is

00:28:40.250 --> 00:28:42.760
actually I HAVE to live.

00:28:42.760 --> 00:28:48.090
Im is immortal or more specifically not allowed
to die.

00:28:48.090 --> 00:28:52.790
While she can grant the celestial dragons
immortality, she herself might have gotten

00:28:52.790 --> 00:28:55.040
hers in a different way.

00:28:55.040 --> 00:28:59.790
You've probably already heard the idea that
Im had the immortality surgery performed on

00:28:59.790 --> 00:29:00.790
her.

00:29:00.790 --> 00:29:06.890
Well, what if that person was none other than
our giant version of Luffy 800 years ago.

00:29:06.890 --> 00:29:11.170
The reason why Im keeps this straw hat, is
because it belongs to the person who saved

00:29:11.170 --> 00:29:17.180
her life, just like Robin was saved by her
giant and later by her straw hat.

00:29:17.180 --> 00:29:23.220
The title of chapter 397, where Saul saves
Robin is 'To Reach the future'.

00:29:23.220 --> 00:29:25.940
Not only Robin, but also Im?

00:29:25.940 --> 00:29:31.820
And the other big clue that Im had the immortality
surgery performed on her, is chapter 660.

00:29:31.820 --> 00:29:35.910
Here once again we have the symbol of the
frozen giants on Punk hazard.

00:29:35.910 --> 00:29:44.700
The title of this chapter is 'The royal Shijibukai,
Trafalgar Law'.

00:29:44.700 --> 00:29:49.490
This is where the symbol of the frozen giant
and the OP OP no mi come together.

00:29:49.490 --> 00:29:54.570
The word play for this chapter is Ro Ru Mu
- Law Room as well as Memory.

00:29:54.570 --> 00:30:01.160
Which is funny, because memory is symbolized
in One Piece by the falling of snow.

00:30:01.160 --> 00:30:04.570
Snow by the way represented by Monet, Sugars
older sister.

00:30:04.570 --> 00:30:08.530
And this will be our clue to what happened
to cause the void century.

00:30:08.530 --> 00:30:14.400
A period between 800 and 900 years ago that
cannot be told, that has been erased from

00:30:14.400 --> 00:30:18.400
memory and where any research is forbidden
by penalty of death.

00:30:18.400 --> 00:30:19.400
T

00:30:19.400 --> 00:30:24.090
his is exactly what happened to Ohara, after
finding out that a huge kingdom was destroyed

00:30:24.090 --> 00:30:25.570
during these 100 years.

00:30:25.570 --> 00:30:26.570
Me?

00:30:26.570 --> 00:30:29.890
The motif here is most likely the French 100
year war.

00:30:29.890 --> 00:30:30.890
Remember?

