00:33:19.200 --> 00:33:24.300
Now the image of the snow queen is most likely
connected to the story by Hand Christian Andersen,

00:33:24.300 --> 00:33:28.530
which actually has little to do with the Disney
version.

00:33:28.530 --> 00:33:32.520
Basically, there is an evil troll that creates
a distorting mirror.

00:33:32.520 --> 00:33:38.350
A piece of that mirror gets stuck into the
heart of a boy, so his personality changes

00:33:38.350 --> 00:33:40.530
and is taken by the snow queen.

00:33:40.530 --> 00:33:45.710
His friend Gerda sets out to find the boy
and heals his distorted heart with her love

00:33:45.710 --> 00:33:46.710
and tears.

00:33:46.710 --> 00:33:50.070
All taking place under the beautiful northern
lights.

00:33:50.070 --> 00:33:56.670
The important things to take from this story
that inspired Oda are snow, memory, the queen,

00:33:56.670 --> 00:33:58.800
light and the mirror.

00:33:58.800 --> 00:34:04.341
In 902, which represents the erasure of memories,
not only did big mom , the queen, pudding

00:34:04.341 --> 00:34:09.749
