00:34:34.909 --> 00:34:38.480
There is a literal mirror ball and light.

00:34:38.480 --> 00:34:52.759
Django first appears in chapter 25, titled
800 lies, for no apparent reason as well.

00:34:52.759 --> 00:34:57.139
In other words, I believe that the way Im-sama
and the other Celestial Dragons manipulated

00:34:57.139 --> 00:35:02.819
