strong light, used the reflection of that

00:35:07.410 --> 00:35:10.390
light to manipulate peoples memories.

00:35:10.390 --> 00:35:15.190
Just as the strong light in the story of Princess
Kaguya after which she lost her memories.

00:35:15.190 --> 00:35:18.339
