00:36:10.170 --> 00:36:11.170
Part III.

00:36:11.170 --> 00:36:12.910
Imu's devil fruit.

00:36:12.910 --> 00:36:17.970
Now the last riddle to solve is the question,
what makes Imu so powerful that she can rule

00:36:17.970 --> 00:36:20.859
the world, next to her three eyed powers?

00:36:20.859 --> 00:36:22.730
Does she have a devil fruit?

00:36:22.730 --> 00:36:24.309
Yes she does.

00:36:24.309 --> 00:36:26.940
And it's an AWESOME devil fruit as well.

00:36:26.940 --> 00:36:32.380
In fact it has something to do with water,
but it's not what you think.

00:36:32.380 --> 00:36:35.289
It's actually a mythical devil fruit.

00:36:35.289 --> 00:36:39.210
The initial hint we get for this is actually
the alabasta saga.

00:36:39.210 --> 00:36:43.599
It's the parallel arc to Dressrosa, and so
it was no big surprise for me that it also

00:36:43.599 --> 00:36:45.549
had something to do with Im.

00:36:45.549 --> 00:36:50.079
The Saga is about Crocodile trying to steal
the country to acquire the ancient weapon

00:36:50.079 --> 00:36:54.490
