supply.

00:36:54.490 --> 00:36:59.720
The purpose of the Baroque Works organization
is to realize an ideal world, and just like

00:36:59.720 --> 00:37:06.170
no-one knows about Im, no-one knows the real
identity of Mr. 0 aka crocodile.

00:37:06.170 --> 00:37:07.309
Spoiler alert.

00:37:07.309 --> 00:37:13.900
Crocodiles weakness is water, so if we invert
this, it makes water Im's strength.

00:37:13.900 --> 00:37:19.940
Chapter 212 when natural rain finally falls
