00:37:35.160 --> 00:37:39.279
However the idea of controlling water is not
only limited to alabasta.

00:37:39.279 --> 00:37:43.869
Fishman island, the opposite of Marijoe, has
the martial art fishmen karate, that allows

00:37:43.869 --> 00:37:47.650
