00:37:59.749 --> 00:38:04.089
As you know there are weaker and stronger
versions of certain devil fruits out there.

00:38:04.089 --> 00:38:10.310
Im's fruit would then be the more powerful
version of Monet's Snow fruit and even Aokiji's

00:38:10.310 --> 00:38:11.680
Ice fruit.

00:38:11.680 --> 00:38:16.249
Because if you can control the moisture in
the air, you can also freeze things.

00:38:16.249 --> 00:38:19.190
You can even create storms and other weather
patterns.

00:38:19.190 --> 00:38:23.710
The most powerful fruit in the world.

00:38:23.710 --> 00:38:29.549
The concepts of water and rain are closely
tied to her character.

00:38:29.549 --> 00:38:31.759
Imu in reverse means umi.

